<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="container-fluid">
  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4">
    <h2><i class="bi bi-newspaper me-2"></i>News Article</h2>
    <div>
      <a href="/news/edit/<%= news.id || '1' %>" class="btn btn-warning me-2">
        <i class="bi bi-pencil me-2"></i>Edit
      </a>
      <a href="/news" class="btn btn-secondary">
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-2"></i>Back to News
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
      <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
        <h4 class="mb-0">Company Achieves Record Growth</h4>
        <span class="badge bg-success">Published</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-2">
        <small><i class="bi bi-person me-2"></i>Admin User</small>
        <small class="ms-3"><i class="bi bi-calendar me-2"></i>15th January 2025</small>
        <small class="ms-3"><i class="bi bi-eye me-2"></i>245 views</small>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="mb-4">
        <h6 class="text-muted">Summary</h6>
        <p class="lead">Company reports 25% growth in Q4 2024</p>
      </div>

      <hr>

      <div class="mb-4">
        <h6 class="text-muted">Full Article</h6>
        <p>We are thrilled to announce that our company has achieved record growth this quarter. This remarkable achievement is a testament to the hard work and dedication of our entire team.</p>
        
        <p>The 25% growth in Q4 2024 exceeds our initial projections and positions us strongly for continued success in the coming year. Key factors contributing to this growth include:</p>
        
        <ul>
          <li>Expansion into new markets</li>
          <li>Launch of innovative products</li>
          <li>Improved customer satisfaction</li>
          <li>Operational efficiencies</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>We look forward to building on this momentum and achieving even greater success in 2025.</p>
      </div>

      <hr>

      <div class="mb-3">
        <strong>Category:</strong> <span class="badge bg-info">Company News</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-3">
        <strong>Tags:</strong>
        <span class="badge bg-secondary me-2">growth</span>
        <span class="badge bg-secondary me-2">achievement</span>
        <span class="badge bg-secondary">quarterly</span>
      </div>

      <div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-4">
        <button class="btn btn-primary">
          <i class="bi bi-share me-2"></i>Share
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-info">
          <i class="bi bi-printer me-2"></i>Print
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
